 "ecomiconlisttitle0_ecomf34fru6hip5_f34fru6hip5_html": "100 day money-back guarantee when purchased with the complete Phoenix Gravity system",
 "title0_0kgkby7rknxk_html": "Removes more than <br> 95% of fluoride",
 "title1_0kgkby7rknxk_html": "Housed in highest-grade stainless steel ",
