 "headingtext_cvz8v5zrwif_html": "Product description:",
 "textcontent_21o5ex9rkw6j_html": "<ul><li>World\u2019s first refillable fluoride removal cartridge uses advanced technology to remove more than 95% of fluoride, without using reverse osmosis.<\/li><li>Fuses natural force of gravity with the highest-grade environmentally-friendly materials for the most effective and sustainable Fluoride removal on the market.<\/li><li>Less waste and plastic than other fluoride removal cartridges - no electricity required.<br><\/li><\/ul>",
 "textcontent_fcg8fvq2dfd_html": "<ul><li>Housed in 304 stainless steel, the most chemically-neutral and safe material for domestic water filtration, perfectly compatible with all Gravity Systems and easy to set up.<\/li><li>The POSTreat is designed for maximum re-use, with our replaceable proprietary<a href=\"\/products\/postreat-fluorid-media-refill\"> <font color=\"#f1d14e\">FluoRid Filtration media<\/font><\/a>- refillable every 4 months.<\/li><\/ul>",
 "view_more_text_vd14n558zgp_html": "View more",
 "view_less_text_vd14n558zgp_html": "View less",
 "headingtext_7wggpvb2b3y_html": "Designed for durability",
 "textcontent_0ioshksnajgv_html": " <ul><li>Like the Phoenix Gravity System, the POSTreat has a stainless steel housing that won't leach polyurethane, microplastics, toxins or harmful chemicals into your water over time.<\/li><li>Rust-resistant to withstand the rigours of everyday use for 10+ years.<\/li><li>The uniquely replaceable FluoRid Media sachets last for 4 months.<br><\/li><\/ul>",
 "headingtext_037i333bcuod_html": "Better quality you can taste, on tap.",
 "buttoncontent_awcs2j2f8h_html": "Complete Purchase",
 "headingtext_yfjfj90hyol_html": "Go one step further for \nfluoride removal:",
 "textcontent_aea6pxjqpdj_html": "<ul><li>Our additional POSTreat filter removes more than \n95% of fluoride for highly targeted filtration<\/li><li>Works in tandem with Phoenix Gravity Filters made of \n304 grade stainless steel<\/li><li>Designed for maximum reuse, the first on the market \nwith refillable environmentally-friendly materials<br><\/li><\/ul>",
 "buttoncontent_ss2uq2gd6y_html": "Shop now",
 "headingtext_j5rk9bbw2l_html": "Filtration At Its Finest",
 "title0_hy0bfeafq_html": "Removes more than 95% <br> of fluoride",
 "title0_v2e8oizkyi_html": "Compatible with Phoenix <br> Gravity Filter System",
 "title0_ncopcyzjiw7_html": "Highest-grade <br> stainless steel",
 "title0_yog81uuo1j_html": "Planet-friendly <br> purification",
 "title0_y2i0bvbvijq_html": "Fresh taste you <br> can trust",
 "title0_8kxeenei6u3_html": "Less waste, fewer <br>refills, lower cost",
 "headingtext_b1t1e2xuyx9_html": "Why fluoride-free water?\n",
 "textcontent_veltwyp3g9e_html": "From skeletal fluorosis, a condition that weakens bones, to potential impacts on the thyroid and nervous system, the risks associated with fluoride ingestion are growing. Children are particularly vulnerable to fluoride's effects, with studies linking it to lower IQ and impaired cognitive development.\n",
 "textcontent_mzuvqqde09_html": "It's crucial to be informed about the fluoride levels in your water supply. \n\nPhoenix Gravity POSTreat fluoride removal cartridges are designed to remove up to 95% of the fluoride in your water.\n\nBecause we care about your health and the well-being of your family.\n",
 "headingtext_gmp9hju6q4q_html": "Ready To Experience Water, As It Should Be?",
 "buttoncontent_vbyl439pblg_html": "Complete Purchase",
 "headingtext_7r1lng6wjij_html": "FAQs",
 "item_title_0_obyhwb3w3en_html": "Is the POSTtreat compatible with all gravity filters or just the Phoenix Gravity Filter?",
 "item_title_1_obyhwb3w3en_html": "Can I set it up myself?",
 "item_title_2_obyhwb3w3en_html": "Can I clean my POSTtreat Fluoride Filter?",
 "textcontent_fxwrc56lf3f_html": "The POSTreat is compatible with all gravity filtration systems. Remember, it can\u2019t be used alone - so you must have a gravity filtration system and existing Carbon Cartridge to use it. <div><\/div>",
 "textcontent_o41lz187f0t_html": "Absolutely. The POSTtreat is designed for easy DIY set-up with your Phoenix Gravity System.&nbsp;<div>You simply attach your POSTtreat cartridges to the exposed thread of the Carbon Cartridges. We\u2019ll send detailed assembly instructions with your POSTreat filter.<\/div>",
 "textcontent_icztbf9rrkg_html": "Yes, it\u2019s simple! You can clean the stainless steel casing of the POSTreat filter - without the FluoRid media inside - in your home using tap water and a soft brush or mild abrasive. The FluoRid media itself will need to be replaced every 4 months. We\u2019ll include detailed instructions when we send it to you. ",
 "headingtext_sda8y9q08s_html": "Still have a burning question? See our full FAQs <a href=\"\/pages\/faq\">here.<\/a> ",
 "headingtext_7yt4sozijtk_html": "The Phoenix difference, straight from the source(s)."
 }
